# Force LF in the repository, on every platform.
#
# This is not cosmetic. `review-revision` compares the pre-revision commit
# against the rewritten chapter via `git diff` — CRLF churn fills that diff
# with lines that changed nothing, degrading the skill that closes the
# revision cycle. Books created from this template inherit the protection.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these, whatever the extension conventions say.
*.docx binary
*.epub binary
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary

# Markdown diffs show the nearest heading in the hunk header, so `git diff`
# names the scene you changed instead of just the line numbers.
*.md diff=markdown
